  evidenceId: EV-GRANT-005
  displayName: Project Lighthouse Financial Summary
  category: 3
  description: "An audited expenditure sheet for Project Lighthouse recovered from Dr. Mitra's confidential research binder. Red annotations in Ananya's handwriting highlight three unapproved wire transfers totaling ₹4,80,000 to 'V.D. Advisory Services.' Stapled to the summary is a corporate registration printout obtained by Dr. Mitra from the Ministry of Corporate Affairs database: it explicitly lists the sole registered proprietor and bank signatory of 'V.D. Advisory Services' as Prof. Vikram Desai, citing his university faculty ID (#FAC-1082) and official residential address. A handwritten note reads: 'Embezzlement verified with banking ombudsman. Direct conflict of interest. Delivering formal dossier to University Syndicate on Monday.'"
  icon: {fileID: 0}
